egration"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The student should not become purely a software developer or purely a hardware engineer. The major advantage of Computer Engineering is the ability to understand the complete computing stack."},{"type":"flow","items":["HARDWARE","Microcontroller / CPU","Firmware","Device Drivers","Operating System","Middleware / APIs","Application","Cloud / Connected System"]},{"type":"p","text":"A graduate who can design, program, debug, test, and integrate this entire chain will be well positioned for hardware-software integration roles across embedded systems, automotive, robotics, IoT, industrial automation, consumer electronics, aerospace, networking, and edge-AI products."}]}]}